T6  Heron square = (x+y+z)*x*y*z;  Lagrange 4-sq; Gauss 3-tri (EYPHKA)
======================================================================
Ravi x=s-a,y=s-b,z=s-c -> s=x+y+z, Area^2=(x+y+z)*x*y*z for the 5 m=1 triangles:
  (5,12,13) s=15 (x,y,z)=(10,3,2) (x+y+z)xyz=900 =? A^2=900  True
